# Large flasher binaries (~102 MB each) — exceed GitHub's 100 MB/file limit and
# bloat history. They stay on disk in this folder but are NOT tracked by git.
#   - 9802810007       : original NVIDIA bundle (input)
#   - nvflash_unlocked : reproducible at any time with:  ./nv_unlock.py 9802810007
#   - nvflash_eng      : byte-identical copy of nvflash_unlocked
/9802810007
/nvflash_unlocked
/nvflash_eng
*_unlocked

# Python / runtime scratch
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Runtime logs produced by running the flasher
nvidia_update_error.log
*.log
